# Config file for makeimage, meant to be used to generate a 51x51 image of a Moffat
# function with FWHM = 2.59 pixels and beta = 3.1 (appropriate for SDSS r-band
# image of IC 3478)

NCOLS  51
NROWS  51

# Circular Moffat
X0    190.0
Y0    150.0
FUNCTION Moffat
PA		0.0
ell		0.0
I_0		1.0
fwhm  0.8316	
beta	3.8
